/v1/","context":{"app_id":4075990,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"},{"game_id":"steam-4075990","metric":"demo_ccu","observed_at":"2026-10-26T08:18:11Z","value":0,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=4407830","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4075990-1846018067935948","game_id":"steam-4075990","kind":"announcement","title":"The factory and drilling loop comes together - v0.5.0","summary":"With this patch I am hoping to create a finalized demo experience. Core Splitter will be in the October Next Fest. You can still expect a 2 - 3 hour playtime for finishing the demo run.For a while Core Splitter had a problem where the drill's output was not that useful. This has now been addressed, I have introduced new ways to convert the output of the drill into parts for the factory. There’s now a reason to keep scaling up your production line and drill speed.With the ability to place sites y","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-10T10:49:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067935948","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:37:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4075990-1830163047257776","game_id":"steam-4075990","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch 6 - Visual overhaul, belt fixes - v0.4.1","summary":"Reworked energysystem to give a more clear overview of status of energy in the last 10 seconds and last 1 minute on average.New sciencehub building sprite, old placeholder replaced:Belts now properly connect into each other to form a path: Items on belts are still jumping when they transfer, that may be fixed in a future update.Visual changes:Max brightness: Colors are blended better, contact shadows, different bloom, more general color scheme and lighting: Settings:","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-16T15:22:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830163047257776","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:37:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4075990-1828894815565297","game_id":"steam-4075990","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch 5 - New Core Splitter Drill Tiers and Deeper Drilling - v0.4.0","summary":"Tier 1 and Tier 2 drills are now available in the demo. Tier 3 and beyond will be reserved for the full game.Additionally you can now progress to the Crust 2 layer in the demo.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-06T13:58:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1828894815565297","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:37:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4075990-1828894815561436","game_id":"steam-4075990","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch 4 - Light Buddy, new tech, new abilities - v0.3.4","summary":"More golden tile upgradesMany golden tiles at once possible now, more Core Essence production!New demo Technology available Anti RAS Laser, Doubles damage to RAS tendrils when mining them manually. New resource Core Essence Chunk, made in Core Essence Crusher from Core Essence: You are now able to build advanced recipes light Lamp Posts (bigger light source) from Core Essence Chunks. I am going to add more recipes that make use of this.Light buddy and light buddy upgrade, take your little buddy ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-03T22:26:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1828894815561436","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:37:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4075990-1828894815558555","game_id":"steam-4075990","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch 3 - Drilling Overhaul and New Abilities- v0.3.3","summary":"Abilities are now triggered based on fuel spent New ability Golden Tile: There's also a bigger tile grid and a lot of rebalancing.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-02T20:24:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1828894815558555","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:37:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4075990-1828441623110605","game_id":"steam-4075990","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch 2 - New features and New building! - v0.3.2","summary":"Your FeedbackThese are all changes based on your feedback! Keep it coming and thanks everyone for the feedback so far!Flow Restrictor buildingThe Restrictor can look ahead on a belt path and allows you to set a max number of items allowed on that belt path at once.When placing the Restrictor, it highlights the belt path that it will look at. This can go as far as to the next building, excluding teleporters and dividers.Recipe BookThe Recipe book shows all the available recipes in the game, how t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-30T19:58:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1828441623110605","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:37:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4075990-1828441623106337","game_id":"steam-4075990","kind":"update","title":"Demo Launch - Patch 1 Onboarding and QoL - v0.3.1","summary":"QoLYou can now add or remove 5 or 10 items to the crafting quantity at once in the Crafting menu when pressing ctrl click or shift click.You can now use the scrollwheel up or down to add/subtract quantity in the Crafting menu.There is more guidance towards placing the first building (Utility Hub) in the build menuThere is a new hint explaining that the map is infinite and procedurally generated. (People were running out of resources and couldn't find more in the explored map and thought they wer","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-28T10:21:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1828441623106337","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:37:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4075990-1826362059930217","game_id":"steam-4075990","kind":"announcement","title":"What's new - Playtest 2 - Boss fights, Objectives, Relics","summary":"An opening cinematic when starting a new game.Broadcasts that convey story elements (work in progress).New ground textures/biomes.Added an \"Objectives\" panel.Earlier Core Splitter Drill in tech tree, decoupled from earlier prerequisitesThe player can now Dash with Space or Shift key.Added Relics, interact with them and see what happens.Added Boss fights in SitesSound effects updated/replaced for almost everything.UI elements now snap together and open/close together with inventory.Added multiple","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-09T13:20:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1826362059930217","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:37:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4075990-1824644522843891","game_id":"steam-4075990","kind":"announcement","title":"Core Splitter is playable, join the playtest now!","summary":"As of the 15th of February 2026 Core Splitter has entered it's first Playtest phase ːsteamhappyː Thanks to those who already started playing.The game is in a ready to play state with a subset of technologies/features locked behind a \"demo locked\" gate. It is very important to me to gather as much feedback as possible in this phase so that when the Demo releases in a few weeks/months the main issues are gone.Here's the new trailer:I expect the game to be somewhat bugfree but I am hoping for feedb","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-02-15T18:45:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1824644522843891","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:37:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4075990-1822556746165172","game_id":"steam-4075990","kind":"announcement","title":"Advanced underground drill mechanics - #Devlog 2","summary":"The Core Splitter Drill #Devlog 2In the previous version of Core Splitter, there was no interactive component to the Core Splitter Drill. It was just casually drilling ang progressing. That needed to change. So I added the Underground Drill View. Here's an early prototype version of that: With the prototype I verified that it definitely added to the experience so I made it more advanced and added the real assets:At this point it was was fun to look at but I quickly lost interest, there was no re","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-01-25T11:57:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1822556746165172","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:37:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4075990-1819386365107936","game_id":"steam-4075990","kind":"announcement","title":"From prototype to a full game - #Devlog 1","summary":"From prototype to a full game #Devlog 1I'm sure many of you saw the earliest version of Core Splitter, published back in October after it got some coverage from Orbital Potato and Glidercat (Thanks guys!). After a somewhat positive reception and despite a few \"Factorio clone\" comments I have been working hard to take Core Splitter from a prototype to a real game. Here's an update on how that's been going over the last two months: A new look and feelI have ditched most of the assets from the old ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-12-25T12:48:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1819386365107936","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:37:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4075990":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:04:26Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T01:04:25Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4075990":"2026-10-26T01:04:26Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4075990":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:04:25Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T01:04:25Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4407830":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:04:26Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T01:04:26Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4075990","app_id":4075990,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:27Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"dd2e2ce761a1c7aae54d124a8354e6d3a4e344aedd66677ad520035beeb6ccaf","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"거대한 레이저 드릴 **‘코어 스플리터 드릴’**에 동력을 공급하는 공장을 건설하세요. 전투 유닛 생산을 자동화하고 자동 전투(오토 배틀)에 투입해 적 거점을 점령하세요. 점령한 거점의 산출물을 사용해 드릴을 업그레이드하고 더 큰 보상을 획득하세요. 에너지 소비와 아이템 생산의 균형을 맞춰 공장을 최적화하세요.","publishers":[{"name":"Splitter Studio"}],"developers":[{"name":"Splitter Studio"}]},"release":{"is_coming_soon":true,"custom_release_date_message":"출시 예정","coming_soon_display":"text_comingsoon"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Core Splitter Demo Launch Trailer","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FIL